escape_class: review_caught_late
gate_evidence:
  disposition: gate_strengthened
  gate_id: review-caught-contract-drift
  owner: pm-ciadvisoryreceipt
  negative_control: "Run the CI workflow receipt contract before adding failure retention: no upload step exists for the receipt, so the same regression fails. The contract also evaluates failed and successful static jobs and rejects non-static jobs. Remove the lint step from the parsed real workflow: the old uploadIndex>findIndex predicate still admits because findIndex=-1; the corrected explicit lintIndex>=0 requirement refuses this missing-boundary case."
